### Observability API - example requests (VS / VS Code REST Client / Rider)
# Host run (dotnet run): http://localhost:5080   Docker compose: http://localhost:8080
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5080

### Liveness (no dependencies)
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/live

### Readiness (SQL Server only; Seq/Collector outages do not affect it)
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/ready

### Create a product (201 + Location). Change the SKU to create another one.
# @name create
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json
X-Correlation-ID: demo-create-001

{
  "sku": "demo-1001",
  "name": "Demo widget",
  "description": "Created from products.http",
  "price": 12.50
}

### Get it back
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products/{{create.response.body.$.id}}
X-Correlation-ID: demo-get-001

### List (bounded paging: page 1..1000, pageSize 1..100)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products?page=1&pageSize=10

### Update with optimistic concurrency: "version" must be the value last read
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/products/{{create.response.body.$.id}}
Content-Type: application/json
X-Correlation-ID: demo-update-001

{
  "name": "Demo widget v2",
  "description": "Updated",
  "price": 13.00,
  "version": "{{create.response.body.$.version}}"
}

### Same update again with the now-stale version -> 409 ProblemDetails
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/products/{{create.response.body.$.id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Stale writer",
  "price": 1,
  "version": "{{create.response.body.$.version}}"
}

### Duplicate SKU -> 409 ProblemDetails
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json
X-Correlation-ID: demo-conflict-001

{ "sku": "DEMO-1001", "name": "Duplicate", "price": 1 }

### Validation failure -> 400 ValidationProblemDetails (errors keyed by field)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json
X-Correlation-ID: demo-invalid-001

{ "sku": "!", "name": "", "price": -1 }

### Paging out of bounds -> 400
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products?pageSize=500

### Unknown product -> 404 ProblemDetails
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
X-Correlation-ID: demo-notfound-001

### Continue an upstream W3C trace: the traceId in logs/Jaeger/ProblemDetails will be 4bf92f35...
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002
traceparent: 00-4bf92f3577b34da6a3ce929d0e0e4736-00f067aa0ba902b7-01

### Delete (204), then deleting again returns 404
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/products/{{create.response.body.$.id}}

### OpenAPI document (Development / OpenApi:Enabled=true). Interactive UI: {{baseUrl}}/scalar
GET {{baseUrl}}/openapi/v1.json
